  "oracle_scope": "The pre-stage product scalar root/counter block is copied unchanged into a boundary-only test function. Shared scalar kernels and descendant lowering remain unchanged; 64 forms x 5 native prefixes x 4 source counters x 3 depths compare exact IR/type, diagnostics, counters and surviving scope. This is not a second compiler. Separate native tests also cover all 23 binary x 6 x 6 and 7 unary x 6 scalar signatures.",
